### 测试API端点
### 使用REST Client插件或Postman测试

### 1. 用户登录
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. 获取所有用户 (需要token)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. 创建新用户
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "test123"
}

### 4. 获取所有客户
GET http://localhost:5000/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 5. 创建新客户
POST http://localhost:5000/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "C006",
  "rfid": "RF67890",
  "name": "Test Company"
}

### 6. 获取所有称重记录
GET http://localhost:5000/api/weights
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. 创建称重记录
POST http://localhost:5000/api/weights
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "C001",
  "customer_name": "ABC Corp",
  "waste_type": "Paper",
  "bin_type": "240L",
  "total_weight": 150.5,
  "bin_weight": 5.5,
  "net_weight": 145.0,
  "image_url": "/uploads/test-image.jpg"
}

### 8. 获取特定客户的称重记录
GET http://localhost:5000/api/weights/customer/C001
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 9. 上传图片
POST http://localhost:5000/api/upload
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 10. 外部系统API - 创建称重记录
POST http://localhost:5000/api/external/weight-records
X-API-KEY: ss-api-2023-external-system-key
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="customer_id"

C001
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="total_weight"

125.7
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weighing_time"

2024-01-15T10:30:00Z
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="external-test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 11. 外部系统API - 获取称重记录
GET http://localhost:5000/api/external/weight-records/WEIGH_RECORD_ID_HERE
X-API-KEY: ss-api-2023-external-system-key

### 12. 外部系统API - 更新称重记录
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/external/weight-records/WEIGH_RECORD_ID_HERE
X-API-KEY: ss-api-2023-external-system-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "waste_type": "Plastic",
  "bin_type": "120L",
  "bin_weight": 3.5,
  "net_weight": 122.2
}